# Validates inheritance of `js_tsconfig_package_deps` across Bazel packages.
# A ts_config can only copy its own package's files, so a child without a
# package.json reaches its ancestor's through the ancestor's ts_config:
#
#   dir-a/         — has `package.json`, but the directive is `disabled`, so
#                    dir-a's ts_config MUST NOT carry package.json.
#   dir-a/child/   — has the directive `enabled` and no local package.json;
#                    dir-a has no ts_config carrying one, so it gets no deps.
#   dir-b/         — has `package.json` and the directive `enabled`, so its
#                    ts_config carries package.json.
#   dir-b/child/   — inherits the directive, has no local package.json, and
#                    MUST depend on //dir-b:tsconfig to reach it.
